entityDescription:
The development of "Rock Breaking Hammer" was filed for invention patent at the Patent Office of the Republic of Bulgaria with Int. No. 112750 / 15.06.2018, with authors and applicants: Petar Bodurov, Vasil Genchev, Stefan Genchev.
A prototype of the world&rsquo;s most powerful hammer for disintegrating rocks. Actuated with solid fuel jet engine which provides:
✓ High impact speed - over 20 m/s;
✓ Minimum mass and maximum mobility;
✓ Striking at any angle;
✓ Applicability of inaccessible places.
The company was awarded the&ldquo;Best Innovative Project&rdquo; Diploma for 2017from the Bulgarian Chamber of Commerce and Industry.
